<view wx:if="{{isMock}}" class="demo">内测演示 · 数据仅保存在本机</view>
<view class="page profile-page">
  <view class="profile-page-heading"><text>我的</text><text class="profile-brand">ORIGINAL RALLY</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取成员资料…</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}<button class="text-button" bindtap="retry">重新加载</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="notice">{{notice}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{identityVerified || !member}}" class="profile-hero">
    <button wx:if="{{member}}" class="profile-hero-avatar-button" open-type="chooseAvatar" bindchooseavatar="chooseAvatar" binderror="avatarChoiceFailed" disabled="{{saving || avatarProcessing}}"><image wx:if="{{avatarUrl}}" class="profile-hero-avatar" src="{{avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" data-scope="saved" data-src="{{avatarUrl}}" binderror="avatarFailed"/><view wx:else class="profile-hero-avatar profile-avatar-default">OR.</view><text class="profile-or-badge">OR</text></button>
    <view wx:else class="profile-hero-avatar-button"><view class="profile-hero-avatar profile-avatar-default">OR.</view><text class="profile-or-badge">OR</text></view>
    <view class="profile-hero-name">{{member ? member.nickname : '原始拉力车友'}}</view>
    <view class="profile-kind"><text class="profile-kind-dot"></text>{{member ? kindLabel : '登录后查看个人记录'}}</view>
    <button wx:if="{{member}}" class="profile-member-number" bindtap="copyMemberNumber" disabled="{{memberNumber === '待分配'}}">成员编号 {{memberNumber}} <text wx:if="{{memberNumber !== '待分配'}}">复制</text></button>
    <view wx:if="{{member}}" class="profile-identity-note">编号供主理人核对档案，不能代替身份核实。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{kindExpiresText}}" class="profile-identity-note">身份有效至 {{kindExpiresText}}</view>
    <button wx:if="{{member}}" class="profile-edit-link" bindtap="edit">{{showEdit ? '收起资料编辑' : member.nickname === '新车友' ? '设置头像与昵称' : '编辑头像与昵称'}} <text>›</text></button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{member && identityVerified}}" class="profile-stats" bindtap="points"><view class="profile-stat"><view class="profile-stat-number">{{member.growthPoints}}</view><view class="profile-stat-label">成长积分</view></view><view class="profile-stat"><view class="profile-stat-number">{{member.annualPoints}}</view><view class="profile-stat-label">年度积分</view></view><view class="profile-stat"><view class="profile-stat-number">{{member.completedCount}}</view><view class="profile-stat-label">完成同行</view></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{member && identityVerified}}" class="profile-dossier-card" bindtap="dossier"><view class="profile-dossier-head"><view><text class="profile-dossier-title">{{dossierLoading ? '正在读取骑手资料…' : dossierStatus}}</text><text class="profile-dossier-note">{{dossierError || dossierNote}}</text></view><text class="profile-dossier-count">{{dossierCount}}</text></view><view class="profile-dossier-tags"><text wx:for="{{dossierParts}}" wx:key="name" class="profile-dossier-tag {{item.ready ? 'ready' : ''}}">{{item.name}}</text></view><text class="profile-dossier-open">继续准备 / 查看审核 ›</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!identityVerified && member}}" class="loading">正在核对当前身份…</view>
  <view class="profile-section-heading"><view class="profile-section-marker"></view><text>考核与准备</text><text class="profile-section-sub">记录 · 提交 · 复核</text></view>
  <view class="profile-shortcuts">
    <button class="profile-shortcut" bindtap="safety"><image src="/assets/icons/shield.png" class="profile-shortcut-icon" mode="aspectFit"/><text>安全问答</text></button>
    <button class="profile-shortcut" bindtap="basicSkills"><image src="/assets/icons/trips.png" class="profile-shortcut-icon" mode="aspectFit"/><text>基础控车记录</text></button>
    <button class="profile-shortcut" bindtap="advancedSkills"><image src="/assets/icons/members.png" class="profile-shortcut-icon" mode="aspectFit"/><text>进阶控车记录</text></button>
    <button class="profile-shortcut" bindtap="practice"><image src="/assets/icons/calendar.png" class="profile-shortcut-icon" mode="aspectFit"/><text>练车与活动</text></button>
    <button class="profile-shortcut" bindtap="redemption"><image src="/assets/icons/points.png" class="profile-shortcut-icon" mode="aspectFit"/><text>积分兑换</text></button>
    <button class="profile-shortcut" bindtap="handbook"><image src="/assets/icons/contact.png" class="profile-shortcut-icon" mode="aspectFit"/><text>车队手册</text></button>
  </view>
  <view class="profile-menu profile-club-menu"><view class="profile-menu-row" bindtap="core"><view><view class="profile-menu-title">核心成员与职责</view><view class="profile-menu-caption">公开的协作分工与负责人介绍</view></view><text class="profile-menu-arrow">›</text></view><view class="profile-menu-row" bindtap="handbook"><view><view class="profile-menu-title">车队手册</view><view class="profile-menu-caption">准备、同行与记录说明</view></view><text class="profile-menu-arrow">›</text></view><view class="profile-menu-row" bindtap="rules"><view><view class="profile-menu-title">积分说明</view><view class="profile-menu-caption">由组织方核实并发布的计分办法</view></view><text class="profile-menu-arrow">›</text></view><view class="profile-menu-row" bindtap="contacts"><view><view class="profile-menu-title">联系我们</view><view class="profile-menu-caption">主要联系办法与补充联络信息</view></view><text class="profile-menu-arrow">›</text></view><view class="profile-menu-row" bindtap="business"><view><view class="profile-menu-title">商务合作</view><view class="profile-menu-caption">留下意向，查看组织方回复</view></view><text class="profile-menu-arrow">›</text></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{member && identityVerified}}" class="profile-menu"><view class="profile-menu-row" bindtap="trips"><view><view class="profile-menu-title">我的同行</view><view class="profile-menu-caption">报名进度、集合准备与完成记录</view></view><text class="profile-menu-arrow">›</text></view><view class="profile-menu-row" bindtap="points"><view><view class="profile-menu-title">积分明细</view><view class="profile-menu-caption">核对积分来源与更正记录</view></view><text class="profile-menu-arrow">›</text></view><view class="profile-menu-row" bindtap="ranking"><view><view class="profile-menu-title">成员排行</view><view class="profile-menu-caption">按实际积分记录查看</view></view><text class="profile-menu-arrow">›</text></view><view class="profile-menu-row" bindtap="privacySettings"><view><view class="profile-menu-title">隐私设置</view><view class="profile-menu-caption">分别管理公开展示的同意</view></view><text class="profile-menu-arrow">›</text></view><view class="profile-menu-row" bindtap="edit"><view><view class="profile-menu-title">头像与昵称</view><view class="profile-menu-caption">头像、昵称与自己的成员档案</view></view><text class="profile-menu-arrow">›</text></view><view wx:if="{{staff}}" class="profile-menu-row" bindtap="staff"><view><view class="profile-menu-title">员工工作台</view><view class="profile-menu-caption">报名确认、现场核验与活动结算</view></view><text class="profile-menu-arrow">›</text></view><view wx:if="{{isOwner}}" class="profile-menu-row" bindtap="members"><view><view class="profile-menu-title">成员与身份管理</view><view class="profile-menu-caption">核对成员身份，管理工作权限</view></view><text class="profile-menu-arrow">›</text></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{identityVerified && avatarError && !showEdit}}" class="notice error">{{avatarError}}<button wx:if="{{member.hasAvatar}}" class="text-button" disabled="{{avatarLoading}}" bindtap="retryAvatar">重新读取头像</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{identityVerified && (!member || showEdit)}}" id="profile-editor" class="card profile-panel">
    <view class="card-title">{{member ? '设置头像与昵称' : isMock ? '建立演示身份' : '用微信登录'}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{!member}}" class="small muted mt">{{isMock ? '当前使用虚构人物与本机数据。浏览活动无需建立身份；同意后可演练报名及个人记录。' : '浏览活动无需登录。登录后，使用微信专属标识关联你的报名与成长记录；头像和昵称均可稍后填写。'}}</view>
    <block wx:if="{{member}}">
      <view class="profile-avatar-editor mt"><button class="profile-avatar-choice" open-type="chooseAvatar" bindchooseavatar="chooseAvatar" binderror="avatarChoiceFailed" disabled="{{saving || avatarProcessing}}"><image wx:if="{{avatarDraftUrl && !draftPreviewFailed}}" class="profile-edit-avatar" src="{{avatarDraftUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" data-scope="draft" data-src="{{avatarDraftUrl}}" binderror="avatarFailed"/><image wx:elif="{{!avatarDraftUrl && avatarUrl}}" class="profile-edit-avatar" src="{{avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" data-scope="saved" data-src="{{avatarUrl}}" binderror="avatarFailed"/><view wx:else class="profile-edit-avatar profile-avatar-default">OR.</view></button><view class="grow"><view class="card-title">{{avatarProcessing ? '正在准备头像…' : '选择微信头像或照片'}}</view><view class="small muted mt">头像只在你自己的资料页显示。{{isMock ? '保存在本机。' : '保存在本小程序云端。'}}</view></view></view>
      <view wx:if="{{avatarError}}" class="notice error">{{avatarError}}<button wx:if="{{member.hasAvatar}}" class="text-button" disabled="{{avatarLoading}}" bindtap="retryAvatar">重新读取已保存头像</button></view>
      <view wx:if="{{avatarBase64}}" class="small muted mt">新头像尚未保存。</view>
      <view class="field"><text class="field-label">昵称（可用微信昵称，也可自己填写）</text><input type="nickname" value="{{nickname}}" maxlength="24" bindinput="nickname" bindblur="nicknameBlur" bindnicknamereview="nicknameReview" placeholder="点击选择微信昵称或填写俱乐部称呼" disabled="{{saving}}"/></view>
      <view class="small muted mb">点击昵称框，可在键盘上方选择微信昵称。头像和昵称均可随时修改，不会自动公开。</view>
      <view wx:if="{{nicknameError}}" class="notice error">{{nicknameError}}</view><view wx:elif="{{nicknameStatus === 'pending'}}" class="small muted mb">填写后请点键盘“完成”，待昵称检测通过再保存。</view>
    </block>
    <checkbox-group wx:if="{{!member}}" bindchange="consent"><label class="check-line"><checkbox value="accepted" checked="{{consent}}" color="#FF6B00"/><text>我已阅读隐私与使用说明，同意使用{{isMock ? '本机演示身份' : '微信专属身份标识'}}记录报名、核验与成长。无需手机、头像或定位权限。</text></label></checkbox-group>
    <button wx:if="{{!member}}" class="text-button mb" bindtap="privacy">{{showPrivacy ? '收起隐私说明' : '阅读隐私与使用说明'}}</button>
    <button class="primary full" disabled="{{saving || avatarProcessing || (!member && !consent) || nicknameStatus === 'pending' || nicknameStatus === 'rejected' || nicknameStatus === 'timeout'}}" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">{{member ? '保存个人资料' : isMock ? '同意并建立演示身份' : '同意并用微信登录'}}</button>
    <button wx:if="{{member}}" class="text-button full" disabled="{{saving || avatarProcessing}}" bindtap="edit">稍后再填</button>
  </view>
  <block wx:if="{{member && identityVerified}}"><view class="profile-section-heading"><view class="profile-section-marker"></view><text>公开展示</text></view><view class="card profile-panel"><view class="profile-setting-head"><view class="card-title">俱乐部推荐</view><text class="profile-setting-status {{member.recommendationOptIn ? 'is-public' : ''}}">{{member.recommendationOptIn ? '已公开' : '未公开'}}</text></view><view class="small muted mt">公开昵称与成员身份。推荐顺序和积分名次分开；积分与次数需要另行同意公开。</view><button class="secondary full mt" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="recommendation">{{member.recommendationOptIn ? '退出公开推荐' : '了解并同意公开推荐'}}</button><view class="divider"></view><view class="profile-setting-head"><view class="card-title">积分榜</view><text class="profile-setting-status {{member.rankingOptIn ? 'is-public' : ''}}">{{member.rankingOptIn ? '已公开' : '未公开'}}</text></view><view class="small muted mt">按实际记录排序，公开昵称、积分与完成次数。</view><button class="secondary full mt" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="rankingConsent">{{member.rankingOptIn ? '退出积分榜' : '了解并加入积分榜'}}</button><view class="profile-panel-note">两项分别生效。退出公开展示不影响成员身份和活动参加。</view></view></block>
  <view wx:if="{{identityVerified && member && member.memberKind !== 'founder'}}" class="card profile-panel"><view class="card-title">核对成员身份</view><view class="small muted mt">既有成员可向主理人申请核对。核定不授予员工权限，也不增加积分或技能资格。</view><view wx:if="{{member.kindRequestStatus === 'pending'}}" class="notice">核对申请待处理，可通过组织方联系办法补充说明。</view><block wx:else><view class="field"><text class="field-label">核对线索（选填）</text><input value="{{kindReason}}" maxlength="300" bindinput="kindReason" placeholder="原使用称呼或其他必要说明"/></view><button class="secondary full" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="requestKind">申请核对成员身份</button></block></view>
  <view wx:if="{{isOwner && identityVerified}}" class="profile-menu"><view class="profile-menu-row" bindtap="dossierQueue"><view><view class="profile-menu-title">骑手资料审核</view><view class="profile-menu-caption">核对已提交版本，记录通过或退回原因</view></view><text class="profile-menu-arrow">›</text></view><view class="profile-menu-row" bindtap="clubManagement"><view><view class="profile-menu-title">栏目与咨询管理</view><view class="profile-menu-caption">编辑公开信息，处理商务与兑换咨询</view></view><text class="profile-menu-arrow">›</text></view></view>
  <view class="profile-section-heading"><view class="profile-section-marker"></view><text>联系组织方</text></view><view class="card profile-panel"><view class="card-title">{{contact.contactName || contact.name}}</view><view wx:if="{{contact.configured}}" class="small muted mt">{{contact.contactInstructions || '活动安排、报名与记录问题，请通过以下方式联系。'}}</view><view wx:if="{{contact.configured}}" class="profile-contact-value">{{contact.contactValue}}</view><button wx:if="{{contact.configured}}" class="secondary full mt" bindtap="contact">{{contact.contactMethod === 'phone' ? '联系工作人员' : '复制联系信息'}}</button><view wx:else class="small muted mt">组织方尚未提供联系办法，活动开放前需先补齐。</view></view>
  <view id="profile-privacy" class="profile-menu profile-privacy-menu"><view class="profile-menu-row" bindtap="privacy"><text class="profile-menu-title">隐私与使用说明</text><text class="profile-menu-arrow">{{showPrivacy ? '−' : '＋'}}</text></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{showPrivacy}}" class="card privacy-text profile-panel"><view class="card-title mb">个人信息的使用</view><view class="paragraph">1. 公开活动可直接浏览。同意登录后，使用微信专属标识关联昵称、报名、核验、成员身份与成长流水。本机演示使用虚构身份，不进行真实微信登录。

2. 头像与昵称均为选填，只有你主动选择头像并保存后才会记录。头像只用于自己的资料页，本机演示保存在本机，真实环境保存在本小程序云端，不加入公开推荐或积分榜。选择头像时仅处理你确认的图片，不读取其他相册内容；不主动获取手机号或定位。不要在昵称、核对线索或普通说明中填写敏感资料。

3. 本人查看自己的记录，有授权的工作人员为活动组织、资格核对和结算使用必要资料。成员身份与员工权限分别管理。骑手资料由你主动填写，可包含联系办法、经本人同意提供的紧急联系人、装备和车辆照片；草稿本人可见，提交快照由主理人核对。目前不收集证件号、血型、病史和证照照片。知识练习及技能提交分别保留实际作答和审核记录，商务与兑换咨询仅本人和有权限的组织方查看。

4. 俱乐部推荐与积分榜分别征求同意，默认不公开。活动评价的正文、昵称和荣誉展示分别由你确认，公开前由组织方核对，可撤回评价。组织方发布照片和视频前需确认公开使用权。已经打开的临时图片链接可能在短暂有效期内继续显示。

5. 可以修改昵称、申请核对身份、更正记录或提交注销申请。因安全核验、争议处理或法定义务需要保留的记录，由组织方说明依据与期限。

6. 更正、隐私与注销问题，请通过本页组织方联系办法反馈。真实内测前，组织方应完善微信隐私保护指引中的主体和有效联系方式。</view><view class="notice">参加活动须满足本场资格、装备和安全要求。成员身份与积分都不替代技能或现场核验。</view><button wx:if="{{member && identityVerified}}" class="text-button full profile-delete" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="deletion">提交注销申请</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{isMock}}" class="card profile-panel profile-demo-panel"><view class="profile-setting-head"><view class="card-title">演示身份</view><text class="profile-setting-status">本机</text></view><view class="small muted mt">人物和活动均为虚构。切换身份，查看普通车友、创始成员与工作人员的不同流程。</view><picker mode="selector" range="{{roles}}" bindchange="role"><view class="picker mt">当前：{{roleLabel}} <text>切换 ›</text></view></picker><button class="secondary full mt" bindtap="reset">重置本机演示数据</button><view class="profile-panel-note">恢复整套演示数据，并按当天重新生成现场记录。</view></view>
  <view class="footer-note">ORIGINAL RALLY · 原始拉力</view>
</view>
